text.en:
The following barrios are created in the Municipality of Macrohon, Province of Leyte, to be constituted as follows:
Barrio of Ilihan shall be composed of the sitios of Ilihan Proper, Camalig, Sindangan, Gawisan, Guinabonan, Lunang, Mabanga and Danao;
Barrio Villa Jacinta shall be composed of the sitios of Upper Villa Jacinta Proper, Peng-on, Mahayahay, Canodto, Laray, Luan, Santa Rosa and Camangahan; and Barrio Lower Villa Jacinta shall be composed of the sitios of Lower Villa Jacinta Proper, Suba, Central, Babayon, Muldes, Boayahan and Pancil.
